  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation and extension of water supply in the volcanic region in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Securing sustainable water supply for the population of Rubavu, Nyabihu and Musanze districts by developing viable projects that aim at(a) increasing the current water supply to meet the growing demand of the targeted Districts for the next 15-20 years,(b) protecting and better management of water supply infrastructure and their feeding sources and(c) enhancing the management of water supply schemes.Although the project focuses on the three Districts of Rubavu, Nyabihu and Musanze, also parts of neighbouring Districts will be considered in case of cross-border water supply systems.</narrative>
  </description>
